section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 657.4, 173.5, 682.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 125261/S-158 BLA 761044/S-009", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 574.6, 331.6, 627.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Jessica Miller, MS, RAC Manager, Global Regulatory Affairs, Immunology Welsh & McKean Roads, PO Box 776", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 560.8, 204.2, 572.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Spring House, PA 19477", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 519.4, 156.0, 530.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Ms. Miller:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 464.2, 528.3, 503.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license application (sBLA), dated and received September 17, and 22, 2023, respectively, submitted under section 351(a) of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara (ustekinumab).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 409.0, 539.1, 447.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for addition of the adverse reaction of hypersensitivity vasculitis into the Postmarketing Experience section of the label.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 381.1, 215.4, 392.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL & LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 340.0, 539.7, 365.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 312.1, 214.7, 323.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 215.8, 532.5, 296.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDA.gov, 1 that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the Prescribing Information and Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 174.3, 503.1, 199.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As. 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 146.8, 441.0, 158.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 117.9, 456.8, 127.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 83.4, 534.4, 104.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "2 We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance Documents Database https://www.fda.gov/RegulatoryInformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5136638", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.0, 643.3, 540.0, 654.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 742.0, 173.5, 753.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/S-158", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 728.2, 173.5, 739.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044/S-009", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 714.4, 110.1, 725.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 581.0, 539.0, 688.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 553.0, 297.4, 564.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 456.9, 535.8, 537.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Under the Pediatric Research Equity Act (PREA) (21 U.S.C. 355c), all applications for new active ingredients (which includes new salts and new fixed combinations), new indications, new dosage forms, new dosing regimens, or new routes of administration are required to contain an assessment of the safety and effectiveness of the product for the claimed indication(s) in pediatric patients unless this requirement is waived, deferred, or inapplicable.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 415.5, 505.8, 440.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Because none of these criteria apply to your application, you are exempt from this requirement.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 387.5, 243.4, 399.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 346.5, 531.8, 371.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 305.1, 525.0, 330.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, call Dawn Williams, Safety Regulatory Project Manager, at (301)796-5376.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/30", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 291.3, 331.8, 302.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/31", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 263.6, 502.6, 275.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "{See appended electronic signature page}", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/32", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 180.9, 487.9, 247.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Tatiana Oussova, MD, MPH Deputy Director for Safety Division of Dermatology and Dentistry Office of Immunology and Inflammation Office of New Drugs", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/33", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 167.1, 499.3, 178.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Center for Drug Evaluation and Research", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/34", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 125.7, 166.1, 137.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "ENCLOSURE(S):", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["ENCLOSURE(S):"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/35",